          "quote": "The amount of precipitation strengthening was estimated by Ashby-Orowan [27] mechanism as follow: Δ σ = 5 . 9 f d ( ln d 2 . 5 × 10 4 ) (3) where d is the average particle size of the second phase, μ m; f is the volume fraction of second phase; σ is the contribution of the second phase to the yield strength, MPa.",
